<title>GERMANY: Degussa - Veba does not plan majority.</title>
<headline>Degussa - Veba does not plan majority.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chief executive of German chemicals and metals group Degussa AG said on Wednesday that Veba AG had no immediate plans to build up a majority holding in Degussa.</p>
<p>&quot;My estimation is that Veba is not attempting a majority takeover,&quot; Uwe-Ernst Bufe told Reuters, referring to Veba's earlier announcement that Degussa would continue to be traded in its own right.</p>
<p>Veba on Wednesday said it planned to take over a 36.4 percent stake in Degussa, making it the largest shareholder.</p>
</text>
